{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他没再等一个不会伤到任何东西的办法，接着做眼前的事，久违的劲头又回来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"劲头又回来了\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他只管把眼前能做的做好，不再逼自己每次努力都得把事情扭转过来。\",\n      \"key\": \"扭转过来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得那种生活，也不想放下眼前该做的事，怕顾住这头就伤了那头。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得那种生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"那份担心又冒出来，他心里晃了一下，还是带着不安往前走，不用装作不怕，也不必等犹疑消失才坚定。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里晃了一下\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并调整箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不再等待无损办法和久违的劲头回归。S11-4说明他已知道再硬撑也难免伤到一边，S02-2说明行动曾让他获得力量；S11-6改连S12-4，解释他心里未安稳仍能继续向前。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并删除弱箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不再要求每次努力扭转一切的意思。删除S11-2到S12-2的箭头，因为行动没有消除牵挂，并不能直接推出他放下了扭转一切的要求。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R62\", \"R63\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并精简\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他舍不得的生活、眼前该做的事，以及害怕顾此失彼的矛盾；删去心里没底仍继续往前的重复意思，由S12-4承接。保留编号，后续引用不变。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留担心重新冒出、心里短暂动摇后仍继续行动的变化，并明说他不必假装不怕，也不必等犹疑消失才坚定，补足B3。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5f7fc149-ee1c-4944-924b-0fe0fb3df294", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T191632617372Z", "elapsed_seconds": 416.985, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:23:29.608676+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "be535611265b711d1fe290ea134497c0116cfcdd5397f638752b53678c9c7400", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T191632617372Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e3dcc56471eac5531eea507d20f4d0ff7f609e82e5af37ee06a1a4f6fe59860e"}}}
